:INFO
Art. 61
1 The Swiss Science Council (SSC) is a permanent advisory committee under Article 8a paragraph 2 Government and Administration Organisation Ordinance of 25 November 1998. Administratively, it is assigned to the EAER.
2 It runs its own administrative office.
3 The resources for the SSTC’s operations shall be set in the SERI budget.
|

:NOTE
